# Cycle-stamped for stray-key.probe; see its header for the run and what to
# expect. Neptune offers keyboard and joystick control and takes whichever you
# touch first, so the opening keypress both starts the game and chooses the
# keyboard.
25000000 74
# J: steer left.
30000000 74
# Q: not one of I/J/K/M, so the game reads it and leaves the strobe set.
31500000 81
# K: steer right. Impossible while the latch stayed wedged.
33000000 75
34000000 75
